WEBVTT

48:03.247 --> 48:05.706
No more

48:10.379 --> 48:14.340
But no, it can't be true

48:14.424 --> 48:17.593
I could fly if I wanted to

48:17.678 --> 48:20.388
Like a bird in the sky

48:20.472 --> 48:23.307
If I believed I could fly

48:23.392 --> 48:26.018
Why, I'd fly

48:26.103 --> 48:28.896
To infinity and beyond!
